# ER Diagram (Concepts, Questions, Dependencies)

```mermaid
erDiagram
    CONCEPT {
        string node_id PK
        string subject
        string concept_type
        int level
        int question_count
    }
    QUESTION {
        string question_id PK
        string subject
        string topic
        string micro_concept
    }
    TOPIC {
        string topic_id PK
        string subject
        string topic_name
    }
    PREREQUISITE {
        string prereq_id PK
        string dependency_type
    }
    CONCEPT ||--o{ CONCEPT : "has_child"
    CONCEPT ||--|{ PREREQUISITE : "needs"
    CONCEPT }|--o{ QUESTION : "assessed_by"
    QUESTION }o--|| TOPIC : "belongs_to"
```
